WEBVTT

00:01.950 --> 00:07.980
<b>Episode 9
Battle! Fever! Fighter D!</b>

00:12.000 --> 00:14.240
<b>You're all beat up.
Huh?</b>

00:14.240 --> 00:16.550
<b>Did a boss monster do this?</b>

00:18.340 --> 00:21.510
<b>Draggie-kun… Please…</b>

00:22.590 --> 00:25.430
<b><i>Let Blue know about this…</i></b>

00:36.690 --> 00:38.200
<b>Ishikawa!</b>

00:39.070 --> 00:40.570
<b>I'm getting lonely here.</b>

00:41.030 --> 00:42.770
<b>Stop hiding and come out already!</b>

00:45.770 --> 00:48.870
<b><i>Geez… What a tomboy.</i></b>

00:51.780 --> 00:53.030
<b>Look!</b>

00:53.030 --> 00:56.030
<b>A majestic appearance that accepts all!</b>

00:56.700 --> 00:58.550
<b>This is the Burst Form!</b>

00:59.030 --> 01:01.410
<b><i>He's just started talking all on his own.</i></b>

01:01.410 --> 01:03.270
<b>It's like giving a metal rod to an ogre!</b>

01:03.270 --> 01:06.120
<b>You're truly the weapon I deserve!</b>

01:06.120 --> 01:09.310
<b>Now then, will you fight
alongside me, partner?</b>

01:09.310 --> 01:11.570
<b><i>This is bad.</i></b>

01:11.570 --> 01:14.570
<b><i>At this rate,
I really don't think I stand a chance.</i></b>

01:15.810 --> 01:18.680
<b>I give up! I surrender.
</b>

01:18.910 --> 01:20.660
<b>What?</b>

01:25.990 --> 01:27.190
<b>Through this exam,</b>

01:27.190 --> 01:30.440
<b>I'm made aware of how foolish I was.</b>

01:30.870 --> 01:34.290
<b><i>I was too simplistic
to rely on the Dragon Keepers as a trophy.</i></b>

01:34.690 --> 01:37.950
<b>But now I know.
</b>

01:39.630 --> 01:40.930
<b>If I become a Dragon Keeper,</b>

01:40.930 --> 01:45.390
<b>I'll be able to show off my charms
to all the women in the world!</b>

01:45.390 --> 01:48.120
<b>Yamato Kurusu's Operation Harem!</b>

01:48.120 --> 01:50.210
<b>This is everything to me!</b>

01:50.210 --> 01:51.400
<b>Gross!</b>

01:54.960 --> 01:57.720
<b>Ranmaru… No.</b>

01:57.720 --> 02:00.150
<b>Just… who are you?</b>

02:19.070 --> 02:20.990
<b>Go! Go! Loser Ranger!</b>

03:44.880 --> 03:46.140
<b>I'm nothing like you</b>

03:46.140 --> 03:48.490
<b>who joined the Rangers
to satisfy your own sexual desires.</b>

03:48.930 --> 03:51.410
<b>My determination
is much stronger than yours!</b>

04:04.860 --> 04:06.760
<b>Koguma?
</b>

04:06.760 --> 04:07.860
<b><i>Where's Urabe?</i></b>

04:12.370 --> 04:14.000
<b>Do you still have your key?</b>

04:14.870 --> 04:16.020
<b>Yeah.</b>

04:16.020 --> 04:17.120
<b>I see.</b>

04:20.420 --> 04:22.050
<b><i>I've always been alone.</i></b>

04:23.280 --> 04:27.380
<b><i>But I wasn't strong enough
to survive by myself.</i></b>

04:28.380 --> 04:32.060
<b><i>If only I could become someone
that's admired by everyone…</i></b>

04:33.850 --> 04:35.560
<b>Bring it on!</b>

04:35.560 --> 04:38.290
<b>Come at me, both of you!</b>

04:57.900 --> 05:00.150
<b>Koguma, I give up!</b>

05:01.150 --> 05:05.300
<b>No matter which team wins,
Yukino is the winner in Yellow Squad!</b>

05:07.800 --> 05:10.160
<b>Leave the key with me for now.</b>

05:10.160 --> 05:11.930
<b>That's fine by me.</b>

05:14.910 --> 05:17.270
<b>You… You've got to be kidding!</b>

05:17.270 --> 05:19.540
<b>Why are you protecting me
when I'm your enemy?</b>

05:22.300 --> 05:26.320
<b>I didn't want to join the Rangers
and build a harem.</b>

05:26.940 --> 05:30.050
<b>I joined the Rangers to do so.</b>

05:30.490 --> 05:33.990
<b>Like I said,
I'm after all the women in this world.</b>

05:35.060 --> 05:39.810
<b>It would be meaningless to hurt
a cute girl like you to pass.</b>

05:39.810 --> 05:41.120
<b>That's gross.</b>

05:41.570 --> 05:42.830
<b>Are you stupid?</b>

05:43.320 --> 05:45.160
<b><i>That guy's insane.</i></b>

05:45.160 --> 05:46.710
<b><i>I knew it.</i></b>

05:47.090 --> 05:50.630
<b><i>My determination is nothing like yours.</i></b>

05:51.080 --> 05:53.430
<b>Wow! Amazing!</b>

05:53.430 --> 05:54.580
<b>Nice!</b>

05:55.050 --> 05:56.580
<b>Looking good!</b>

05:57.050 --> 05:58.580
<b>Your muscles are a national treasure!</b>

05:59.100 --> 06:01.340
<b>The Burst Form pales in comparison!</b>

06:03.270 --> 06:05.840
<b>Look at me! I'm the strongest man!</b>

06:07.090 --> 06:08.570
<b>Huh?
</b>

06:08.570 --> 06:10.280
<b>Finally out of power.</b>

06:10.280 --> 06:11.780
<b>So it really just uses up energy</b>

06:11.780 --> 06:13.600
<b>stored inside the gadget.
Hmm?</b>

06:13.600 --> 06:16.600
<b>Sorry, Shippou, but I'm winning this one!</b>

06:18.100 --> 06:20.290
<b>Hmm.</b>

06:26.860 --> 06:28.590
<b>So that's all it does.</b>

06:28.960 --> 06:30.870
<b>I don't even need a weapon
in the first place!</b>

06:30.870 --> 06:31.870
<b>What?</b>

06:31.870 --> 06:35.040
<b>The only thing you can trust
is your own body!</b>

06:35.040 --> 06:37.080
<b>Because your muscles
will never betray you!</b>

06:39.300 --> 06:40.880
<b>I surrender!</b>

06:40.880 --> 06:42.890
<b>I'm serious this time…</b>

06:44.480 --> 06:46.030
<b>Are you trying to trick me again…</b>

06:46.030 --> 06:47.880
<b>Here, I'll give you the key.</b>

06:49.380 --> 06:50.780
<b>Hmm.</b>

06:56.640 --> 06:59.640
<b>I have secured the Pink key!
</b>

07:03.400 --> 07:06.000
<b>Huh? It's out of power already?</b>

07:11.290 --> 07:13.970
<b><i>Actually, there's still
a little bit of energy left.</i></b>

07:13.970 --> 07:17.160
<b><i>But I can only use the Burst Form
for a short time.</i></b>

07:22.350 --> 07:24.270
<b>Hands off the gadget.</b>

07:25.100 --> 07:26.490
<b>I'm shocked.</b>

07:26.490 --> 07:28.940
<b>I didn't expect you
to be this nearby, Ishikawa.</b>

07:28.940 --> 07:30.170
<b>This is surprising.</b>

07:30.170 --> 07:34.180
<b>Did you think that I'd never risk
standing on the front lines?</b>

07:34.180 --> 07:38.180
<b>I've been fighting continuously
in this dark underground.</b>

07:38.610 --> 07:41.080
<b>The requirements to become
an official Ranger are tough,</b>

07:41.080 --> 07:44.440
<b>and as the years go on,
my contemporaries have all retired.</b>

07:44.870 --> 07:46.460
<b><i>Now, they have their own families</i></b>

07:46.460 --> 07:47.840
<b><i>and become servile to society.</i></b>

07:47.840 --> 07:50.630
<b><i>They've forgotten all about
that gigantic fortress above their heads</i></b>

07:50.630 --> 07:52.950
<b><i>as they enjoy this temporary peace.</i></b>

07:52.950 --> 07:54.930
<b>I'm different from them!</b>

07:54.930 --> 07:58.950
<b>I have a sense of duty
to fight evil and protect world peace!</b>

07:58.950 --> 08:03.210
<b>I'm being sacrificed
for their happy families and peace!</b>

08:03.210 --> 08:05.460
<b>You're no different from them.
</b>

08:05.460 --> 08:07.230
<b>Everyone's fighting.</b>

08:07.730 --> 08:10.210
<b>Do not think you're all that special.</b>

08:10.690 --> 08:13.320
<b>Ishikawa… You're just pretending to fight,
that's all.</b>

08:14.970 --> 08:16.950
<b>You think I'm just trying to threaten you?</b>

08:17.360 --> 08:19.470
<b>You think
I'm just pretending to shoot you?</b>

08:19.470 --> 08:22.480
<b>At this range,
the pain won't be all you get!</b>

08:23.160 --> 08:24.480
<b>So?</b>

08:24.480 --> 08:27.850
<b>If you had the determination
to sacrifice yourself for the world,</b>

08:27.850 --> 08:29.730
<b>this would have ended already.</b>

08:43.750 --> 08:46.100
<b>Huh? This is strange…</b>

08:46.100 --> 08:48.390
<b>I can't move my body.</b>

08:50.440 --> 08:52.760
<b>The key is still with me!</b>

08:52.760 --> 08:55.530
<b>Well… That's fine…</b>

08:56.010 --> 08:59.510
<b>I managed to buy some time.
I've completed my mission.</b>

09:00.070 --> 09:03.020
<b>I win! Huh?</b>

09:04.240 --> 09:06.520
<b>You held on well, Usukubo.</b>

09:06.520 --> 09:08.410
<b>Leave the rest to me.</b>

09:21.540 --> 09:22.870
<b><i>Shit, this is bad!</i></b>

09:29.220 --> 09:32.300
<b>That guy… Where did he go?</b>

09:35.860 --> 09:37.320
<b><i>That was close…</i></b>

09:39.300 --> 09:40.700
<b>How did you…</b>

09:41.530 --> 09:44.310
<b>Never mind,
I'll just put you in the ground again.</b>

09:44.310 --> 09:46.830
<b>I'm envious that you're a simpleton.</b>

09:46.830 --> 09:50.310
<b>Have you never questioned that?
Are you dumb?</b>

09:50.310 --> 09:52.320
<b>I don't want to hear that from a moron.</b>

09:52.320 --> 09:54.820
<b>Huh? You dumbass! Idiot!</b>

09:56.570 --> 09:58.230
<b><i>Damn it, Shion.</i></b>

09:58.230 --> 10:00.550
<b><i>I get that you're desperate.</i></b>

10:00.550 --> 10:01.930
<b><i>It's all for your brother,</i></b>

10:01.930 --> 10:04.830
<b><i>and to exact revenge
on the monsters and Rangers.</i></b>

10:05.830 --> 10:09.560
<b><i>And in order to completely deny you,
I will win you.</i></b>

10:09.560 --> 10:13.090
<b><i>I will be the one to have my revenge
against the Rangers!</i></b>

10:22.860 --> 10:25.790
<b>You're all wounded, aren't you?</b>

10:25.790 --> 10:27.980
<b>How about handing over your key now?</b>

10:27.980 --> 10:29.330
<b><i>You're kidding me…</i></b>

10:29.330 --> 10:31.710
<b><i>There's no way
we're ending the fight like this!</i></b>

10:40.340 --> 10:43.990
<b><i>What? This pipsqueak's
my Junior First Rank substitute?</i></b>

10:44.720 --> 10:47.850
<b>The Blue Squadron sure has fallen.</b>

10:48.340 --> 10:49.940
<b>Blue Keeper,</b>

10:49.940 --> 10:53.500
<b>I think you should be more careful
with your words.</b>

10:53.500 --> 10:54.730
<b>The hell?</b>

10:54.730 --> 10:57.610
<b>How dare you talk back to me!
You want to die?</b>

10:58.480 --> 11:00.410
<b>You won't be able to make it
as a Dragon Keeper</b>

11:00.410 --> 11:02.870
<b>if the public is scared of you.</b>

11:02.870 --> 11:05.010
<b>This is my advice as your partner.</b>

11:05.010 --> 11:09.270
<b>Who the hell is your partner,
you cocky brat? Die, you damn trash!</b>

11:09.700 --> 11:12.250
<b>For the afternoon, you'll be patrolling
the White Dragon's Nest,</b>

11:12.250 --> 11:13.710
<b>and then return to the Blue base--</b>

11:13.710 --> 11:16.170
<b>Stop tagging around me, damn pipsqueak.</b>

11:16.870 --> 11:20.530
<b>Hey! You can't skip out on duties to nap!</b>

11:20.530 --> 11:22.780
<b>You're a pain in the ass, damn it!
</b>

11:24.130 --> 11:26.720
<b>Hey, Blue!
You shouldn't be picking fights…</b>

11:26.720 --> 11:28.980
<b>Perfect timing, Aizome.</b>

11:28.980 --> 11:32.290
<b>Let's slaughter all these guys together.
 We're not slaughtering them!</b>

11:32.290 --> 11:35.520
<b>I'm sorry. He just looks evil
and talks in a crude manner.</b>

11:35.520 --> 11:38.300
<b>He doesn't have any ill will,
so let's resolve this amicably…</b>

11:46.560 --> 11:49.830
<b>Blue, you're not allowed
to talk in front of people from now on!</b>

11:49.830 --> 11:51.580
<b>The heck? Are you crazy?</b>

11:53.280 --> 11:57.320
<b>Because… I don't want you
to be misunderstood anymore…</b>

12:07.330 --> 12:10.830
<b>Blue… You really…</b>

12:12.760 --> 12:14.670
<b>are a hero.</b>

12:16.340 --> 12:19.320
<b>Junior First Rank Aizome!
You're badly hurt…</b>

12:19.320 --> 12:21.340
<b>Contact the Pink Squadron immediately!</b>

12:22.150 --> 12:26.350
<b>Sorry… Blue Squadron members
and the cadets are still underground…</b>

12:26.350 --> 12:28.910
<b>Blue, please save them…</b>

12:33.350 --> 12:35.860
<b>Oh, right…</b>

12:38.040 --> 12:39.920
<b>You can talk now.</b>

12:41.610 --> 12:43.110
<b>Divine Artifact, Manifest!</b>

12:43.110 --> 12:44.860
<b>Blue Dragon Leviathan!</b>

12:58.130 --> 13:00.130
<b><i>Wh-What's happening…</i></b>

13:04.190 --> 13:05.890
<b>Found you.
</b>

13:05.890 --> 13:07.030
<b>Are you…</b>

13:08.480 --> 13:11.450
<b>the one who hurt my partner?</b>

13:15.900 --> 13:17.120
<b>Judgement time!</b>

13:17.700 --> 13:22.150
<b>By the laws of yours truly,
you shall receive the death sentence!</b>

13:24.200 --> 13:26.950
<b>Liars will swallow a thousand needles.</b>

13:26.950 --> 13:28.910
<b>Enjoy the taste to your heart's content!</b>

13:28.910 --> 13:31.410
<b>Blue Keeper? Why is he here?</b>

13:31.410 --> 13:34.410
<b><i>XX! What are you doing?</i></b>

13:34.970 --> 13:39.420
<b>Koguma… Why is he being chased
by the Blue… Keeper…</b>

13:39.890 --> 13:42.570
<b><i>Lord Peltrola
is still injured from their fight</i></b>

13:42.570 --> 13:44.190
<b><i>with the Junior First Rank.</i></b>

13:44.670 --> 13:47.300
<b><i>I won't let him get close.
I have to protect them!</i></b>

13:47.300 --> 13:49.990
<b><i>That is… my duty as their follower!</i></b>

13:50.400 --> 13:53.680
<b><i>I will repay my gratitude
to Lord Peltrola now!</i></b>

14:07.200 --> 14:08.590
<b>Take this!</b>

14:12.950 --> 14:16.460
<b>Wh-Why am I… still alive…</b>

14:17.010 --> 14:19.350
<b>You think you'd be killed
by the Divine Artifact?</b>

14:19.890 --> 14:22.320
<b>You'd die if I used that.</b>

14:22.320 --> 14:26.470
<b>I'm a nice person,
so I'll deal with you using this thing.</b>

14:29.020 --> 14:30.470
<b>Screw you!</b>

14:31.470 --> 14:34.720
<b>Oh, come on. You look different now!</b>

14:39.620 --> 14:40.790
<b>What's wrong?</b>

14:45.250 --> 14:48.360
<b>Seems like your senses have been dulled</b>

14:48.360 --> 14:52.380
<b>since you're used to getting beaten up,
but you still feel pain just like we do.</b>

14:53.240 --> 14:54.890
<b>You don't want
to feel the pain anymore, right?</b>

14:56.010 --> 14:57.890
<b>You want release, don't you?</b>

14:59.180 --> 15:01.750
<b>Then tell me where the boss monster is.</b>

15:01.750 --> 15:05.350
<b>Your breath stinks… Don't talk to me.</b>

15:09.940 --> 15:11.240
<b>Your pain will continue</b>

15:11.240 --> 15:13.070
<b>as long as your head's still attached
to your neck.</b>

15:13.860 --> 15:17.270
<b>This is a safe cage,
one where you can't escape from.</b>

15:19.530 --> 15:22.660
<b>I wonder how many stabs you can take
while you're still sane.</b>

15:24.770 --> 15:25.960
<b>Three!
</b>

15:26.440 --> 15:28.280
<b>Four!
</b>

15:30.080 --> 15:31.820
<b>Five!
</b>

15:33.050 --> 15:35.240
<b>Six!
Stop!</b>

15:35.840 --> 15:37.160
<b>Seven!</b>

15:37.760 --> 15:38.850
<b>Stop this…</b>

15:38.850 --> 15:40.430
<b>Eight!
</b>

15:41.680 --> 15:43.350
<b>Nine!
</b>

15:43.790 --> 15:45.520
<b>Please, stop!
 Ten!</b>

15:45.520 --> 15:47.900
<b>Stop, I'm begging you!</b>

15:50.900 --> 15:54.240
<b><i>I can't feel anything other than pain.</i></b>

15:55.530 --> 15:57.740
<b><i>Why am I fighting?</i></b>

15:58.610 --> 16:00.830
<b><i>Why do I have to suffer like this?</i></b>

16:01.240 --> 16:04.370
<b><i>What am I doing…</i></b>

16:05.500 --> 16:08.710
<b><i>Just… who am I?</i></b>

16:11.080 --> 16:12.300
<b>You came to the surface,</b>

16:12.300 --> 16:16.580
<b>clutching onto the hope
that I would still be alive.</b>

16:17.170 --> 16:19.560
<b>Anyone would feel attached
to their own tools</b>

16:19.560 --> 16:21.580
<b>when you keep using them.</b>

16:21.580 --> 16:26.020
<b>I think of you as my beloved child.</b>

16:26.840 --> 16:28.480
<b>Lord Peltrola…</b>

16:28.940 --> 16:32.530
<b>Yes, that reminds me.
You still do not have a name yet, do you?</b>

16:33.340 --> 16:34.820
<b>Very well…</b>

16:37.600 --> 16:40.490
<b>Your name is XX.</b>

16:45.580 --> 16:50.860
<b>I am Fighter XX…</b>

16:50.860 --> 16:54.510
<b>So? If you ain't gonna spit out
where the boss monster is,</b>

16:54.510 --> 16:55.850
<b>then I'm done with you.</b>

16:55.850 --> 16:57.030
<b>Die!</b>

17:08.640 --> 17:11.190
<b>Hey! The hell's going on?</b>

17:11.190 --> 17:14.130
<b>Who's the asshole
pulling this stupid shit?</b>

17:15.570 --> 17:19.130
<b>I-I'm so sorry!
I didn't know it was you, Blue Keeper!</b>

17:19.130 --> 17:21.140
<b>Are you hurt?</b>

17:21.140 --> 17:22.250
<b>What?</b>

17:22.250 --> 17:25.650
<b>Hey, Koguma!
Are you all right?</b>

17:25.650 --> 17:26.750
<b>Tsk.</b>

17:27.120 --> 17:29.290
<b>Do something dumb like that again
and I'll kill you.</b>

17:32.370 --> 17:35.400
<b>That one messed with my squadron.</b>

17:35.400 --> 17:40.090
<b>As the leader, I'll make sure
to avenge my guys and get even.</b>

17:40.720 --> 17:44.450
<b>Any evil deeds are allowed
as long as it's for your comrades.</b>

17:44.450 --> 17:46.020
<b>How wonderful.</b>

17:46.020 --> 17:47.170
<b>Huh?</b>

17:47.170 --> 17:49.020
<b>I wish I could say that too.</b>

17:49.640 --> 17:51.690
<b>Why the hell are you here?</b>

17:52.600 --> 17:54.920
<b>To help my comrade.</b>

17:54.920 --> 17:56.030
<b>What?</b>

18:00.560 --> 18:01.450
<b>Tsk.</b>

18:08.690 --> 18:11.870
<b><i>This is…
Yellow Squadron's Burst Form!</i></b>

18:12.690 --> 18:15.090
<b><i>Now's the time, Sakurama!</i></b>

18:15.090 --> 18:18.450
<b><i>The reason why I'm here
is for this exact moment!</i></b>

18:18.880 --> 18:21.720
<b><i>I'm putting all my humiliation,
regrets, malice,</i></b>

18:21.720 --> 18:24.850
<b><i>and despair into this single strike!</i></b>

18:27.710 --> 18:30.230
<b>Damn you!</b>

18:30.230 --> 18:32.940
<b><i>It'll hit him. I'll kill him!</i></b>

18:33.710 --> 18:38.220
<b>Go! Avenge for all our fallen comrades!</b>

18:50.410 --> 18:51.920
<b>I barely avoided that.</b>

18:51.920 --> 18:55.740
<b>Aizome, it's all thanks to
the cartridge you returned to me.</b>

18:56.740 --> 19:00.260
<b>I see. You're Pink's little brother.</b>

19:01.420 --> 19:04.310
<b>I feel bad for her
knowing that her brother's going to die</b>

19:04.310 --> 19:06.000
<b>from breaking Ranger rules.</b>

19:06.000 --> 19:09.750
<b>I'm just here to save Koguma
since he's my teammate.</b>

19:11.180 --> 19:12.750
<b><i>I get it now.</i></b>

19:15.000 --> 19:18.110
<b>Listen, that guy's a monster…</b>

19:18.600 --> 19:21.510
<b>Never mind,
this is such a pain in the ass.</b>

19:30.520 --> 19:33.270
<b>Aizome! You better watch me!</b>

19:37.580 --> 19:38.530
<b>Dodge!</b>

19:41.280 --> 19:43.780
<b>What the heck were you thinking?</b>

19:43.780 --> 19:44.780
<b>This way!
</b>

19:48.970 --> 19:51.770
<b>That's the Divine Artifact
the Blue Junior First Rank used.</b>

19:51.770 --> 19:53.980
<b>Even the boss monster
had a hard time with it.</b>

19:53.980 --> 19:55.770
<b>We can't do this by ourselves!</b>

19:55.770 --> 19:57.570
<b>This isn't the time to chicken out…</b>

19:57.570 --> 19:59.570
<b>Wait. Boss monster?</b>

20:09.810 --> 20:12.580
<b>That was close! What was that?</b>

20:15.060 --> 20:18.570
<b>My arms… Why aren't they regenerating?</b>

20:19.460 --> 20:21.590
<b>They won't stop hurting!</b>

20:21.590 --> 20:25.070
<b><i>That Divine Artifact's power… Why…</i></b>

20:25.070 --> 20:30.180
<b>You're not even a boss monster.
How dare you butt in, weakass trash!</b>

20:32.580 --> 20:34.420
<b>You've got to be kidding!</b>

20:39.090 --> 20:41.490
<b><i>That's probably
the power of that Divine Artifact</i></b>

20:41.490 --> 20:42.840
<b><i>I got hit with before!</i></b>

20:48.100 --> 20:50.030
<b><i>And they're even homing!</i></b>

20:55.100 --> 20:57.500
<b>I brought you a second helping.</b>

20:57.500 --> 20:59.210
<b>Eat as much as you want.</b>

21:02.610 --> 21:05.620
<b>Go to hell, Dragon Keepers!</b>

21:12.870 --> 21:14.520
<b>XX!</b>

21:16.380 --> 21:19.360
<b>You're badly hurt,
so don't be so reckless!</b>

21:19.360 --> 21:21.880
<b>Leave the rest to me and stay out of this!</b>

21:21.880 --> 21:24.650
<b>No, I'm already at my limit…</b>

21:25.640 --> 21:29.510
<b>There's no way
we can win against that guy.</b>

23:03.370 --> 23:05.530
<b>Translated by Qianni Lu</b>

23:08.200 --> 23:11.700
<b>I'll lead you
to where the boss monster is.</b>

23:11.700 --> 23:12.800
<b>What?</b>

23:15.510 --> 23:18.210
<b>You may be a fighter
but it seems like you value your life.</b>

23:18.210 --> 23:19.350
<b>Damn it.</b>

23:19.350 --> 23:23.110
<b>The Dragon Keepers
are stronger than I expected.</b>

23:23.110 --> 23:25.770
<b>I apologize, Lord Peltrola.</b>

23:26.210 --> 23:29.570
<b><i>Peltrola… is alive?</i></b>

23:31.900 --> 23:36.370
<b>D and XX witness the fierce fight
between Blue Keeper and Peltrola.</b>

23:36.370 --> 23:38.250
<b>He almost stumbled.
And a proper preview again?</b>

23:38.250 --> 23:39.390
<b>What? Isn't this normal?</b>

23:39.390 --> 23:42.230
<b><i>Next episode,
"It's Showtime for Blue Keeper!"</i></b>

23:42.230 --> 23:43.710
<b>See you!
How pleasant!</b>

23:43.710 --> 23:45.270
<b>It's the usual Mr. Inoue!</b>

23:45.270 --> 23:46.480
<b>All right!</b>
